      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\n\nL\xF4 h\xE0ng KARE-FAKE-001 \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1EADp
    kho th\xE0nh c\xF4ng v\xE0o ng\xE0y 20/03/20xx.\nTh\u1EDDi gian: 2 gi\u1EDD s\xE1ng
    (gi\u1EDD \u0111\u1ECBa ph\u01B0\u01A1ng)\n\u0110\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m: Kho
    h\xE0ng b\xED m\u1EADt t\u1EA1i khu c\xF4ng nghi\u1EC7p X, ng\u1EE5y trang d\u01B0\u1EDBi
    danh ngh\u0129a m\u1ED9t c\xF4ng ty v\u1EADn chuy\u1EC3n h\xE0ng h\xF3a th\xF4ng
    th\u01B0\u1EDDng.\nPh\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c v\u1EADn chuy\u1EC3n: Xe t\u1EA3i
    kh\xF4ng bi\u1EC3n s\u1ED1, \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1ED9 t\u1ED1ng b\u1EDFi 2
    xe m\xE1y \u0111\u1EC3 c\u1EA3nh gi\u1EDBi.\nNg\u01B0\u1EDDi nh\u1EADn: M\u1ED9t
    ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE0n \xF4ng b\xED \u1EA9n c\xF3 bi\u1EC7t danh \"\xD4ng
    Tr\xF9m\", kh\xF4ng r\xF5 danh t\xEDnh.\nGhi ch\xFA: To\xE0n b\u1ED9 qu\xE1 tr\xECnh
    di\u1EC5n ra trong im l\u1EB7ng v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\xE1m s\xE1t ch\u1EB7t
    ch\u1EBD. C\xE1c c\xF4ng nh\xE2n b\u1ED1c d\u1EE1 h\xE0ng kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    ph\xE9p s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng \u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i v\xE0 ph\u1EA3i r\u1EDDi
    \u0111i ngay sau khi ho\xE0n th\xE0nh c\xF4ng vi\u1EC7c."
